{"title": "Small Portrait of Vlaakith", "pageid": 42096, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Small_Portrait_of_Vlaakith", "categories": ["Transcripts", "Environmental objects"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Small_Vlaakith_Painting.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Small_Vlaakith_Painting.png/300px-Small_Vlaakith_Painting.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Small_Vlaakith_Painting.png/450px-Small_Vlaakith_Painting.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/0d/Small_Vlaakith_Painting.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Small_Vlaakith_Painting.png/300px-Small_Vlaakith_Painting.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"412\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Small_Vlaakith_Painting.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>Small Portrait of Vlaakith</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <b>Small Portrait of Vlaakith</b> is an interactable object located in the <a href=\"/wiki/Cr%C3%A8che_Y%27llek\" title=\"Crèche Y'llek\">Crèche Y'llek</a> found underneath <a href=\"/wiki/Rosymorn_Monastery\" title=\"Rosymorn Monastery\">Rosymorn Monastery</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Upon interacting with the painting, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel\" title=\"Lae'zel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/25px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/38px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/50px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lae'zel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/25px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel\" title=\"Lae'zel\">Lae'zel</a> identifies the depicted as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vlaakith\" title=\"Vlaakith\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Vlaakith_Icon.webp/18px-Vlaakith_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Vlaakith_Icon.webp/26px-Vlaakith_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Vlaakith_Icon.webp/35px-Vlaakith_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vlaakith\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Vlaakith_Icon.webp/18px-Vlaakith_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Vlaakith_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vlaakith\" title=\"Vlaakith\">Vlaakith</a>. The party can examine the painting more closely, at either the face or the small symbol on the corner:\n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\"></span></span><i>Study the subject's features.</i></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[GITHYANKI]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Gaze upon Vlaakith's regal countenance.</i></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[GITHYANKI]&nbsp;[HISTORY]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Inspect the symbol more closely.</i>&nbsp;(DC 14)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[HISTORY]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Inspect the symbol more closely.</i>&nbsp;(DC 21)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[DEXTERITY]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Draw a new face onto the portrait.</i>&nbsp;(DC 16)</span> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 26px; height: 26px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png/26px-Astarion_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png/39px-Astarion_Approval.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png/52px-Astarion_Approval.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Astarion approves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png/26px-Astarion_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3b8f1f ;\">+1</span></span> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 26px; height: 26px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Karlach_Approval.png/26px-Karlach_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Karlach_Approval.png/39px-Karlach_Approval.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Karlach_Approval.png/52px-Karlach_Approval.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Karlach approves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Karlach_Approval.png/26px-Karlach_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Karlach_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3b8f1f ;\">+1</span></span> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 26px; height: 26px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel\" title=\"Lae'zel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Lae%27zel_Approval.png/26px-Lae%27zel_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/Lae%27zel_Approval.png/39px-Lae%27zel_Approval.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/Lae%27zel_Approval.png/52px-Lae%27zel_Approval.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lae'zel disapproves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Lae%27zel_Approval.png/26px-Lae%27zel_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e6/Lae%27zel_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #cc3f49 ;\">-1</span></span> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 26px; height: 26px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Shadowheart_Approval.png/26px-Shadowheart_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Shadowheart_Approval.png/39px-Shadowheart_Approval.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Shadowheart_Approval.png/52px-Shadowheart_Approval.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadowheart approves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Shadowheart_Approval.png/26px-Shadowheart_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Shadowheart_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3b8f1f ;\">+1</span></span></li></ul>\n</div>\n<p>If the History check is passed, a small symbol painted on it can be recognized as a comet, the sign of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orpheus\" title=\"Orpheus\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/25px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/38px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/50px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Orpheus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/25px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Orpheus\" title=\"Orpheus\">Orpheus</a>. \n</p><p>If the Dexterity check is passed to deface the painting, the painting is turned into the  <b>Vandalised Portrait of Vlaakith</b>, featuring a beard, bushy eyebrows, a monocle and horns. Otherwise, if the check is not passed, the painting is turned into the <b>Portrait of Vlaakith</b>, with some dashes of orange paint running down the canvas. \n</p><p>In both instances <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vis%27kiir\" title=\"Vis'kiir\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Portrait_Vis%27kiir.png/25px-Portrait_Vis%27kiir.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/38/Portrait_Vis%27kiir.png/38px-Portrait_Vis%27kiir.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/38/Portrait_Vis%27kiir.png/50px-Portrait_Vis%27kiir.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Youth Vis'kiir\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Portrait_Vis%27kiir.png/25px-Portrait_Vis%27kiir.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/38/Portrait_Vis%27kiir.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vis%27kiir\" title=\"Vis'kiir\">Youth Vis'kiir</a> comes over and frantically tries to undo the damage before any inquisitor sees. If failing the above check and then spoken to, he puts any consequence befalling the inhabitants of the Crèche on the party. However, this does not appear to happen while the party is there and the vandalism is not noticed by the two Githyanki patrolling the vicinity, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ahu%27u%27rag\" title=\"Ahu'u'rag\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Portrait_Ahu%27u%27rag.png/25px-Portrait_Ahu%27u%27rag.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Portrait_Ahu%27u%27rag.png/38px-Portrait_Ahu%27u%27rag.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Portrait_Ahu%27u%27rag.png/50px-Portrait_Ahu%27u%27rag.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Raider Ahu'u'rag\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Portrait_Ahu%27u%27rag.png/25px-Portrait_Ahu%27u%27rag.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/19/Portrait_Ahu%27u%27rag.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ahu%27u%27rag\" title=\"Ahu'u'rag\">Raider Ahu'u'rag</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Yr%27rk\" title=\"Yr'rk\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Yr%27rk.png/25px-Portrait_Yr%27rk.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Yr%27rk.png/38px-Portrait_Yr%27rk.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Yr%27rk.png/50px-Portrait_Yr%27rk.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Warrior Yr'rk\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Yr%27rk.png/25px-Portrait_Yr%27rk.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/86/Portrait_Yr%27rk.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Yr%27rk\" title=\"Yr'rk\">Warrior Yr'rk</a>.\n</p><p>Vandalising the painting with a sucessful roll causes a chastising from Lae'zel, depending on the approval the party has with her.\n</p><p>Once <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vis%27kiir\" title=\"Vis'kiir\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Portrait_Vis%27kiir.png/25px-Portrait_Vis%27kiir.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/38/Portrait_Vis%27kiir.png/38px-Portrait_Vis%27kiir.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/38/Portrait_Vis%27kiir.png/50px-Portrait_Vis%27kiir.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Youth Vis'kiir\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Portrait_Vis%27kiir.png/25px-Portrait_Vis%27kiir.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/38/Portrait_Vis%27kiir.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vis%27kiir\" title=\"Vis'kiir\">Youth Vis'kiir</a> is focused on the painting the party can easily steal from the decorated barrel next to the painting. However, the party also must wait for the two patrolling warriors to move out of sight.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 446.66666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 444.66666666667px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Screen_Cr%C3%A8che_Y%27llek_Portrait_of_Vlaakith.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Appearance in-game\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Screen_Cr%C3%A8che_Y%27llek_Portrait_of_Vlaakith.jpg/667px-Screen_Cr%C3%A8che_Y%27llek_Portrait_of_Vlaakith.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Screen_Cr%C3%A8che_Y%27llek_Portrait_of_Vlaakith.jpg/1001px-Screen_Cr%C3%A8che_Y%27llek_Portrait_of_Vlaakith.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Screen_Cr%C3%A8che_Y%27llek_Portrait_of_Vlaakith.jpg/1334px-Screen_Cr%C3%A8che_Y%27llek_Portrait_of_Vlaakith.jpg.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Appearance in-game\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Screen_Cr%C3%A8che_Y%27llek_Portrait_of_Vlaakith.jpg/667px-Screen_Cr%C3%A8che_Y%27llek_Portrait_of_Vlaakith.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"445\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Screen_Cr%C3%A8che_Y%27llek_Portrait_of_Vlaakith.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Appearance in-game</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 184px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 182px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Small_Vlaakith_Painting_Vandalized_(Success).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Vandalized successfully\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Small_Vlaakith_Painting_Vandalized_%28Success%29.png/273px-Small_Vlaakith_Painting_Vandalized_%28Success%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Small_Vlaakith_Painting_Vandalized_%28Success%29.png/410px-Small_Vlaakith_Painting_Vandalized_%28Success%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/1/16/Small_Vlaakith_Painting_Vandalized_%28Success%29.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Vandalized successfully\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Small_Vlaakith_Painting_Vandalized_%28Success%29.png/273px-Small_Vlaakith_Painting_Vandalized_%28Success%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"182\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/16/Small_Vlaakith_Painting_Vandalized_%28Success%29.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Vandalized successfully</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 184px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 182px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Small_Vlaakith_Painting_Vandalized_(Fail).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Vandalized unsuccessfully\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Small_Vlaakith_Painting_Vandalized_%28Fail%29.png/273px-Small_Vlaakith_Painting_Vandalized_%28Fail%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Small_Vlaakith_Painting_Vandalized_%28Fail%29.png/410px-Small_Vlaakith_Painting_Vandalized_%28Fail%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/e1/Small_Vlaakith_Painting_Vandalized_%28Fail%29.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Vandalized unsuccessfully\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Small_Vlaakith_Painting_Vandalized_%28Fail%29.png/273px-Small_Vlaakith_Painting_Vandalized_%28Fail%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"182\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e1/Small_Vlaakith_Painting_Vandalized_%28Fail%29.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Vandalized unsuccessfully</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203243\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2563/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 18349/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3445/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/200\nExpensive parser function count: 6/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3582/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 955010/52